SOAPBOX: Ten meters was not as hot as the phone contest but the other bands made up for
SOAPBOX: the difference. Unlike the phone contest 40 meters was very good and 80 was fun!
SOAPBOX: I cranked up the speed to 23 WPM for the last 20 minutes of the contest and
SOAPBOX: noticed that the stations calling were more attentive. I will operate at a
SOAPBOX: higher speed from now on!
SOAPBOX: I noticed that for every real post there were 3 with the wrong call sign. The
SOAPBOX: band map looked like a busy day on FT8 with nothing but calls filling it
SOAPBOX: completely! Those blasted automatic posts! I haven't seen in my life so
SOAPBOX: many AP and TN stations at once!
SOAPBOX: Thanks for the patience. I have fat fingers and hit two keys at once. The real
SOAPBOX: fun in this whole thing is meeting people on all bands!
